# 📖 Overview

AI Farm Companion is an intelligent farming assistant designed to help farmers make **data-driven decisions**.

The application combines:

- 🌿 AI-based Crop Disease Detection
- 💹 Market Price Prediction
- 🌦 Weather Intelligence
- 🤖 AI-powered Farming Assistant
- 🌍 Multilingual Support
- 👨‍🌾 Community Discussion Forum

The goal is to reduce crop losses, improve productivity, and assist farmers in deciding **when to sell their produce**.

---

# 🚀 Features

## 🌱 Crop Disease Detection

- Upload crop/leaf image
- Detect disease using AI
- Confidence score
- Disease severity estimation

---

## 🤖 AI Farming Assistant

- Chat with an AI assistant
- Disease explanation
- Treatment suggestions
- Farming best practices
- Recommendation explanations

---

## 💹 Smart Market Intelligence

- Current crop prices
- Historical price trends
- Predicted future prices
- Sell/Hold recommendation

---

## 🌦 Weather Intelligence

- Current weather
- Rain probability
- Humidity
- Temperature
- Weather risk analysis

---

## 📈 Decision Engine

Combines

- Disease severity
- Market trends
- Weather conditions
- Estimated yield loss

to generate a recommendation:

- ✅ Sell
- ⏳ Hold
- ⚖ Partial Sell

---

## 🌍 Multilingual Support *(Bonus Feature)*

Supported Languages

- English
- Hindi
- Kannada

*(More languages can be added in the future.)*

---

## 👨‍🌾 Community Q&A *(Bonus Feature)*

Farmers can

- Ask questions
- Answer community queries
- View AI-generated suggestions
- Share farming knowledge

