# ⚙ Installation

## Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/<username>/ai-farm-companion.git

cd ai-farm-companion
```

---

## Backend

```bash
cd backend

pip install -r requirements.txt

uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```

---

## Frontend

```bash
cd frontend

npm install

npm run dev
```

